@startuml "Admin Account Management Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
actor "Ban quản lý" as Admin
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "AuthController" as AuthC
participant "AuthService" as AuthS
participant "UserController" as UserC
participant "UserService" as UserS
database "CSDL" as DB

== Xem/Cập nhật thông tin ==
Admin -> FE: Mở thông tin cá nhân
FE -> UserC: GET /api/users/me
UserC -> UserS: getProfile(adminId)
UserS -> DB: SELECT users
DB --> UserS: Dữ liệu
UserS --> UserC: Thông tin
UserC --> FE: 200 OK

Admin -> FE: Cập nhật thông tin
FE -> UserC: PUT /api/users/me
UserC -> UserS: updateProfile(adminId, data)
UserS -> DB: UPDATE users
DB --> UserS: OK
UserC --> FE: 200 OK

== Đổi mật khẩu ==
Admin -> FE: Đổi mật khẩu
FE -> AuthC: PUT /api/auth/change-password
AuthC -> AuthS: changePassword(adminId, old, new)
AuthS -> DB: SELECT + UPDATE users
DB --> AuthS: OK
AuthC --> FE: 200 OK

== Tạo admin mới ==
Admin -> FE: Tạo admin mới
FE -> UserC: POST /api/admins
UserC -> UserS: createAdmin(data)
UserS -> DB: INSERT users
DB --> UserS: OK
UserC --> FE: 201 Created

== Bật/tắt OTP ==
Admin -> FE: Bật/tắt OTP
FE -> AuthC: PUT /api/auth/otp
AuthC -> AuthS: toggleOtp(adminId, enabled)
AuthS -> DB: UPDATE users
DB --> AuthS: OK
AuthC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
